      "id": "claim_fa03e3d796a64faabccdcb0ec5f7f090",
      "statement": "D-2 reactive 401 recovery: on a 401 the ApiClient request path, gated to authenticated non-refresh endpoints (not skipAuth, not /v1/auth/refresh) with per-request replay-once enforced by a private replay parameter that outranks the public options.allowReactiveRefresh opt-out, calls getFreshToken with the failed request's wire Authorization; on success it replays once with authToken dropped so the replay re-reads the rotated store token.",
