      "id": "claim_45b21484c8264eab87a5d5e73be12820",
      "statement": "The single-flight refresh core getFreshToken (src/lib/api-client-refresh.ts) performs at most one POST /v1/auth/refresh at a time (concurrent 401s join the same promise, cleared on settlement), reads the token from the auth store rather than the failed request's revoked token (single-use revocation hazard), applies a rotation-cascade gate where a wire token differing from the store token joins/awaits the pending rotation instead of refreshing, runs under a 10s AbortSignal.timeout deadline, updates the store via the nonce-preserving refreshToken store action, and never rejects (false means surface the original error).",
